    "created_at": "2024-03-03T07:45:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-03T07:45:47Z",
    "body": "It means to prepend a sequence. Otherwise you'd reorder which is never done.\r\n\r\nGetting rid of sequences seems fine. If you're able to sign https://participate.whatwg.org/agreement you could contribute a patch if you're willing.\r\n\r\ncc @andreubotella ",
