    "created_at": "2024-03-03T08:08:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-03T08:08:17Z",
    "body": "Yeah, it's meant to \"restore\" _ioQueue_ as if those bytes were not processed after all, allowing them to be processed anew with the main difference that we now know there's an error of sorts.",
